2026-07-27T10:09:00.8000010Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8000751Z i /tmp/RtmpXUM7t6/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8001083Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8001453Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8001776Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8002284Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8003035Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8004158Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8262965Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8373338Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:09:00.8828342Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T10:09:00.9000083Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
